        </p>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          Whether you need a preventive examination for your child, a single-sitting root canal to relieve excruciating nerve pain, or a smile makeover with invisible aligners, our doctors combine empathetic chairside communication with cutting-edge dental technology. We do not rush appointments; our team takes time to educate you with high-definition digital intraoral photography, explain every anatomical nuance, and co-design a care plan that respects your health goals, lifestyle, and budget.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Key Pillars of Our Dental Practice -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
          The House of Dental Standard: 5 Pillars of Gentle Dental Care in Hennur
        </h3>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-cream/80 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">1. Absolute Pain-Free Dentistry</h4>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
              We employ topical pre-numbing gels and computerized local anesthetic infiltration before every procedure. By buffering anesthetic solutions to match physiological pH, the dreaded stinging sensation is neutralized, ensuring complete numbness prior to treatment.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-cream/80 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">2. Ultra-Low Radiation Digital Imaging</h4>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
              Our clinic utilizes advanced digital RVG (Radiovisiography) sensors that reduce radiation exposure by more than 85% compared to conventional dental film. High-resolution digital radiographs appear instantaneously on chairside monitors for instant diagnostic clarity.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-cream/80 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">3. Uncompromising Hospital-Grade Sterilization</h4>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
              Cross-contamination prevention is paramount. Every metallic tool passes through an enzymatic ultrasonic bath before undergoing Class-B fractional vacuum autoclaving at 134°C. Single-use barriers protect dental chairs, air-water syringes, and touchscreens.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-cream/80 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">4. Transparent, Upfront Pricing</h4>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
              We maintain an uncompromising ethical policy regarding billing. Before any procedure is initiated, patients receive a written breakdown of treatment alternatives, crown material grades (such as monolithic zirconia or lithium disilicate), and exact costs with zero surprise fees.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Comprehensive Dental Services -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
          Specialized Dental Treatments Available at Our Hennur Clinic
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          As a full-scope dental clinic, we cater to all age groups under one roof without unnecessary external referrals:
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-sand/40 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
              <a href="/treatments/root-canal-treatment" class="text-japandi-moss hover:underline">Root Canal Treatment (Painless RCT) &rarr;</a>
            </h4>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
