          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-sand/40 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
              <a href="/treatments/dental-implants" class="text-japandi-moss hover:underline">Dental Implants &amp; Permanent Tooth Replacement &rarr;</a>
            </h4>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Permanent, titanium-anchored prosthetic roots that look, feel, and function exactly like natural teeth. Whether replacing a single missing tooth or rehabilitating an entire dental arch, dental implants prevent jawbone resorption. See our guide on <a href="/dental-implants-hennur" class="text-japandi-moss underline">dental implants in Hennur</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-sand/40 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
              <a href="/treatments/teeth-whitening" class="text-japandi-moss hover:underline">Laser Teeth Whitening &amp; Cosmetic Smile Design &rarr;</a>
            </h4>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Safely lift stubborn stains caused by coffee, tea, smoking, or age with in-office laser whitening. We also provide porcelain veneers, composite bonding, and bridal smile makeovers. Discover our <a href="/teeth-whitening-hennur" class="text-japandi-moss underline">teeth whitening in Hennur</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-sand/40 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
              <a href="/treatments/wisdom-tooth-removal" class="text-japandi-moss hover:underline">Wisdom Tooth Removal &amp; Oral Surgery &rarr;</a>
            </h4>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Gentle extraction of impacted, painful, or partially erupted third molars to prevent pericoronitis, root resorption of adjacent teeth, and facial swelling. Read our complete guide to <a href="/wisdom-tooth-removal-hennur" class="text-japandi-moss underline">wisdom tooth removal in Hennur</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-sand/40 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
              <a href="/treatments/pediatric-dentistry" class="text-japandi-moss hover:underline">Pediatric &amp; Preventive Children's Dentistry &rarr;</a>
            </h4>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Instilling lifelong positive oral hygiene habits in young children. From painless pit and fissure sealants that shield vulnerable deep molar grooves from bacterial decay to remineralizing topical fluoride varnishes and habit interception for thumb-sucking or tongue-thrusting, our dentists ensure your child's visit is filled with laughter and curiosity rather than fear.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-sand/40 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
              <a href="/treatments/cosmetic-dentistry" class="text-japandi-moss hover:underline">Ceramic Veneers &amp; Aesthetic Restorative Bonding &rarr;</a>
            </h4>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Customized ultra-thin lithium disilicate (E-Max) porcelain veneers and biomimetic composite bonding engineered to close midline diastemas (tooth gaps), conceal intrinsic fluorosis discoloration, and rebuild worn incisal edges. We employ digital facial proportion mapping so your enhanced smile seamlessly complements your facial features.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- What to Expect: 4-Step Patient Consultation Experience -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
