        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-japandi-sand/30 border border-japandi-clay/30 space-y-1.5">
            <span class="font-semibold text-japandi-moss uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider block">Step 1: Calm Welcome &amp; Medical Triage</span>
            <p>Relax in our Japandi-designed lounge with zero clinical disinfectant smell. We record your medical history, existing medications, and any specific dental anxiety triggers.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-japandi-sand/30 border border-japandi-clay/30 space-y-1.5">
            <span class="font-semibold text-japandi-moss uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider block">Step 2: Low-Dose Digital RVG Diagnostics</span>
            <p>Our dentists capture high-resolution digital radiographs of suspected areas, exposing you to minimal radiation while uncovering hidden proximal caries or bone levels.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-japandi-sand/30 border border-japandi-clay/30 space-y-1.5">
            <span class="font-semibold text-japandi-moss uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider block">Step 3: High-Definition Intraoral Camera Tour</span>
            <p>See exactly what your dentist sees on a high-definition monitor. We point out micro-fractures, tartar buildup, or early enamel demineralization before treatment begins.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-japandi-sand/30 border border-japandi-clay/30 space-y-1.5">
            <span class="font-semibold text-japandi-moss uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider block">Step 4: Collaborative Treatment Roadmap</span>
            <p>You receive a written treatment plan with transparent tier options, longevity expectations, and exact costs so you make fully informed decisions without pressure.</p>
          </div>
