        <p class="text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          House of Dental is centrally positioned at 2nd Floor, SLV Nilaya, Horamavu Agara Road (immediately adjacent to Nayara Petrol Bunk), making it seamless to reach for families living throughout North-East Bengaluru:
