          <li><strong>From Kalyan Nagar, HRBR Layout &amp; Kammanahalli:</strong> Located just 10 minutes away via the Hennur Cross underpass.</li>
          <li><strong>From Kothanur, Byrathi &amp; Thanisandra:</strong> A swift 8-minute commute along the Hennur-Bagalur corridor.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed pt-2">
